cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SynthRAN in research, please cite the exact software version or
  Git commit used for the experiment.
title: SynthRAN
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Nayreed
    given-names: Rezwan Ahmad
abstract: >-
  SynthRAN is research software for Ambient-IoT modelling and reproducible 5G
  experimentation. It combines energy-aware Ambient-IoT source modelling with
  virtual and physical mobile-network deployment, verification, provenance and
  an evolving end-to-end experiment workflow.
repository-code: https://github.com/RA-Nayreed/SynthRAN
url: https://github.com/RA-Nayreed/SynthRAN
keywords:
  - Ambient IoT
  - energy harvesting
  - backscatter
  - 5G
  - RAN
  - R2Lab
  - research software
  - reproducibility
references:
